<title>FRANCE: Geophysique to list ADS in New York.</title>
<headline>Geophysique to list ADS in New York.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1997-05-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Cie Generale de Geophysique said its capital would be listed on the New York Stock Exchange on Wednesday following a public offering of 4.8 million American Depositary Shares at $17 per share.</p>
<p>The 4.8 million ADS stock represents 960,000 new shares issued on Tuesday at 493.50 francs per share.</p>
<p>The ADS offering may be extended by a further 720,000 ADS, or 144,000 French shares, the company said.</p>
</text>
